  <entry>
    <id>https://www.strangerfoods.org/recipes/salmon-courgette-and-lemon-pasta-with-a-herby-dressing</id>
    <title>Salmon, courgette and lemon pasta with a herby dressing</title>
    <updated>2026-07-20T18:24:33.913390+00:00</updated>
    <content type="html">&lt;h1 style="text-align:center;font-family:sans-serif;"&gt;Salmon, courgette and lemon pasta with a herby dressing&lt;/h1&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;img src="https://www.strangerfoods.org/images/salmon-courgette-and-lemon-pasta-with-a-herby-dressing.webp" style="text-align:center;"/&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;p style="font-family:sans-serif;&gt;This fresh and zingy creamy dressing, bursting with fresh herbs, yoghurt and plenty of black pepper, pairs perfectly with roasted salmon and charred courgettes. While fresh salmon is used here, tinned or smoked salmon are also great budget-friendly options.&lt;/p&gt;</content>
